    "title": "Carmen External API",
    "description": "Read-only API for external systems (for example a customer's accounting system) to pull data out\nof **Carmen**. Each request is authenticated with a **per-business-unit API key**, not a user login,\nand only ever sees the data of the business unit (BU) the key belongs to.\n\nCurrently available: **inventory postings** — committed inventory documents (GRN, CN, SR, SI, SO)\nexported as Dr/Cr posting lines with the GL / AP accounts mapped in Carmen.\n\n## 1. Get an API key\n\nAn administrator of the BU (with the `system_admin.bu_api_key` permission) opens\n**Interface → Accounting → External → API Access** in Carmen and creates the key. The page shows\nthe **client id**, the **secret** (reveal on demand) and the base URL to call.\n\n- One key per business unit. The BU needs the External interface license.\n- **Regenerate** issues a new secret and the old secret stops working **immediately**.\n- Keep the secret in an environment variable or secret store. Never commit it or put it in a URL.\n\n## 2. Base URL\n\n```\n<your Carmen API host>/api/ext/v1\n```\n\nThe host differs per environment; use the URL shown on the API Access page.\n\n## 3. Authentication\n\nSend both headers on every request (no `Authorization` header is needed):\n\n| Header | Value |\n| --- | --- |\n| `x-client-id` | Client id of the key |\n| `x-client-secret` | Secret of the key |\n\nIn this page, click **Authorize** and fill in both values to try the endpoint.\n\n## 4. Quick start\n\n```bash\nexport CARMEN_API=\"https://<your Carmen API host>\"\nexport CARMEN_CLIENT_ID=\"<client id>\"\nexport CARMEN_CLIENT_SECRET=\"<secret>\"\n\ncurl -sS -G \"$CARMEN_API/api/ext/v1/inventory-postings\" \\\n  -H \"x-client-id: $CARMEN_CLIENT_ID\" \\\n  -H \"x-client-secret: $CARMEN_CLIENT_SECRET\" \\\n  --data-urlencode \"date_from=2026-10-01\" \\\n  --data-urlencode \"date_to=2026-10-31\" \\\n  --data-urlencode \"doc_types=GRN,CN\" \\\n  --data-urlencode \"perpage=50\"\n```\n\n## 5. Pagination\n\nResponses carry `paginate: { total, page, perpage, pages }`. Request `page=1,2,…` until\n`page >= pages`. `perpage` is 1–200 (default 50). Documents are ordered by document date,\ndocument no, doc type and id, across all requested types.\n\n## 6. Incremental sync (recommended)\n\nDocuments can be edited or voided after you first read them, so do not rely on the document date alone:\n\n1. First run: `date_field=document` over the periods you need; page through all results.\n2. Each later run: `date_field=updated`, `date_from` = the day of your last successful sync\n   (one day earlier for safety), `date_to` = today.\n3. Upsert by `(doc_type, id)` — the latest version wins — and replace all lines of the document,\n   since line grouping and mapping can change.\n4. A range spans at most 366 days (inclusive).\n\n## 7. Errors\n\nAll errors share one body: `{ success: false, status, message, timestamp, path, error? }`.\n\n| Status | Meaning |\n| --- | --- |\n| 400 | Invalid query parameters; `error.errors` lists the issues. |\n| 401 | `Invalid API credentials` — missing header, unknown client id, wrong secret, inactive key or BU. Same body for every cause. |\n| 403 | The API is not enabled (or the method is not GET — HEAD is rejected too), or the BU's External interface license is missing or expired. |\n| 429 | Rate limit exceeded. Back off and retry. |\n| 503 | Temporarily unavailable (allowlist not loaded, or the license could not be verified). Retry later. |\n\n## 8. Rate limits\n\n- **300 requests per minute per API key** (fixed one-minute window).\n  Requests rejected with 403 or 429 still count.\n- A global **per-source-IP** limit (300 per minute by default) also applies, so several keys polled\n  from the same IP can be throttled before reaching their per-key limit.",
    "version": "v1",
    "contact": {}
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "External API: Inventory Postings",
      "description": "Inventory documents as Dr/Cr posting lines for an accounting system"
    }
  ],
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "/",
      "description": "This server"
    }
  ],
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "x-client-id": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "x-client-id",
        "description": "Client id of the business unit API key"
      },
      "x-client-secret": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "x-client-secret",
        "description": "Secret of the business unit API key"
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "StdResponseMetaDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "type": "number",
            "example": 200
          },
          "success": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "example": true
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "Success"
          },
          "timestamp": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "2026-06-10T08:00:00.000Z"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "status",
          "success",
          "message",
          "timestamp"
        ]
      },
      "StdPaginateDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "total": {
            "type": "number",
            "example": 100
          },
          "page": {
            "type": "number",
            "example": 1
          },
          "perpage": {
            "type": "number",
            "example": 10
          },
          "pages": {
            "type": "number",
            "example": 10
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "total",
          "page",
          "perpage",
          "pages"
        ]
      },
      "PostingLineSwaggerDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "side": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "Dr",
              "Cr"
            ],
            "example": "Dr"
          },
          "role": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "inventory",
              "ap",
              "input_vat",
              "adjustment",
              "sr_in",
              "sr_out"
            ],
            "example": "inventory"
          },
          "account_code": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "GL account resolved from the GL / AP mapping; null when it could not be resolved",
            "example": "1150-01"
          },
          "cost_center_code": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "Resolved cost center",
            "example": "CC-KIT"
          },
          "amount": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Non-negative decimal string, base currency, 2 decimals. `0.00` when issue is `cost_not_found`",
            "example": "1000.00"
          },
          "location_code": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "Null for ap and input_vat",
            "example": "MAIN-STORE"
          },
          "product_code": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "Null for ap and input_vat",
            "example": "FD-1001"
          },
          "item_group_code": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "Null for ap and input_vat",
            "example": "FOOD"
          },
          "unmapped": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "true when account_code is null or issue is set. The amount is still correct; the account needs fixing in the GL / AP mapping",
            "example": false
          },
          "issue": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "Reason code when the line is unmapped, e.g. missing_location, missing_product, missing_item_group, missing_input_vat_account, missing_adjustment_type, cost_not_found, mapping_target_not_found, missing_inventory_account, missing_ap_account, missing_adjustment_account, missing_cost_center, missing_direct_account, account_not_in_coa. Treat an unknown code as \"unmapped, needs review\".",
            "example": null
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "side",
          "role",
          "account_code",
          "cost_center_code",
          "amount",
          "location_code",
          "product_code",
          "item_group_code",
          "unmapped",
          "issue"
        ]
      },
      "PostingDocumentSwaggerDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid",
            "example": "6f1c2a5e-8d4b-4a51-9c0e-2b7d3f9a1c01"
          },
          "doc_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "GRN",
              "CN",
              "SR",
              "SI",
              "SO"
            ],
            "example": "GRN"
          },
          "doc_no": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "example": "GRN261000012"
          },
          "doc_date": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "YYYY-MM-DD in the business unit timezone",
            "example": "2026-10-01"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "final",
              "voided"
            ],
            "description": "voided only for SI/SO voided after completion; keeps the original amounts — reverse on your side",
            "example": "final"
          },
          "updated_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "ISO 8601 timestamp of the last update; filter on it with date_field=updated",
            "example": "2026-10-03T09:41:27.512Z"
          },
          "currency_code": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "Document currency (SR/SI/SO use the BU base currency). Reference only",
            "example": "THB"
          },
          "exchange_rate": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Rate to base currency, decimal string. Reference only",
            "example": "1.000000"
          },
          "vendor": {
            "type": "object",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "Vendor of a GRN / CN; null otherwise",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "uuid"
              },
              "code": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": "V-0042"
              },
              "name": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": "Fresh Farm Supply Co., Ltd."
              }
            }
          },
          "adjustment_type": {
            "type": "object",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "Adjustment type of an SI / SO; null otherwise",
            "properties": {
              "code": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": "ADJ-IN"
              },
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "stock_in",
                  "stock_out",
                  "eop_in",
                  "eop_out"
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "balanced": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "true when total Dr equals total Cr. Amounts are never adjusted to force a balance (SR FIFO rounding or a dropped consignment side can make it false)",
            "example": true
          },
          "lines": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PostingLineSwaggerDto"
            }
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "id",
          "doc_type",
          "doc_no",
          "doc_date",
          "status",
          "updated_at",
          "currency_code",
          "exchange_rate",
          "vendor",
          "adjustment_type",
          "balanced",
          "lines"
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
